    "Quit %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@を終了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quit and Stop All Terminals": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "すべてのターミナルを停止して終了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Quitting (⌘Q) leaves every terminal running, Claude included; the next launch puts them back as they were. To stop everything, hold Option and choose Quit and Stop All Terminals (⌥⌘Q).": {
      "comment": "Help page: what quitting does",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "終了（⌘Q）してもすべてのターミナルはClaudeも含めて動き続け、次に起動したときにそのまま戻ります。すべて止めるには、Optionキーを押しながら「すべてのターミナルを停止して終了」（⌥⌘Q）を選びます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rain": {
      "comment": "Weather",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "雨"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rain and snow": {
      "comment": "Settings › Meadow: real weather",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "雨と雪"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reading the meadow": {
      "comment": "Help page title",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "草原の見かた"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reading the repository…": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "リポジトリを読み込み中…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Reads its settings once, when you choose: fonts and sizes, indentation, wrapping, invisibles, saving, the terminal’s cursor and the colour theme. Nothing is changed there, and nothing is sent anywhere.": {
      "comment": "Settings › General: Import Settings' footer",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "選んだときに一度だけ設定を読み込みます: フォントとサイズ、インデント、折り返し、不可視文字、保存、ターミナルのカーソル、カラーテーマ。元の設定は変更せず、どこにも送信しません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Real sunrise and sunset": {
      "comment": "Settings › Meadow: dawn, day, dusk and night follow the real sun",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "実際の日の出と日の入り"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Real weather asks for your location once. It is rounded to about a kilometer and sent to Open-Meteo, a free weather service, in one request every 15 minutes while real weather is on. Lightning is a soft, rare glow, never with Reduce Motion or the meadow's animation off.": {
      "comment": "Settings › Meadow: what real weather sends where",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "実際の天気は一度だけ現在地を尋ねます。現在地は約1 kmに丸められ、実際の天気がオンの間、15分ごとに1回のリクエストで無料の天気サービスOpen-Meteoに送られます。稲光はやわらかく、ときどき光るだけです。「視差効果を減らす」がオンのときや、草原を動かさないときは光りません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
